  "text_len": 11
 },
 {
  "id": "sce269:000F6",
  "jp": "フェイン「カスミはお前を選んだ。俺ではなくお前を。{nl}　俺は‥‥お前だから身を引くんだ。それなのに‥‥」",
  "off": 246,
  "len": 66,
  "en": "Fain: Kasumi chose you. Not me, you. I... I'm stepping aside because it's you. And yet...",
  "status": "translated",
  "style": 0,
  "text_off": 248,
  "text_len": 63
 },
 {
  "id": "sce269:0013B",
  "jp": "トウヤ「フェイン‥‥」",
  "off": 315,
  "len": 16,
  "en": "Touya: Fain...",
  "status": "translated",
  "style": 0,
  "text_off": 317,
  "text_len": 13
 },
 {
  "id": "sce269:0014E",
  "jp": "フェイン「‥‥お前のことだ。なにか理由があるのだろうが、{nl}　それでもお前は男としてしなければならないことを{nl}　しなかった。それは確かだ。{nl}　もし、少しでも悪いと思うなら、今後はああいう約束は{nl}　しないことだ。今度、同じことをすれば、その時は{nl}　俺はお前を許さない。それだけは言っておく」",
  "off": 334,
  "len": 169,
  "en": "Fain: ...Knowing you, I'm sure you had some reason. Even so, you didn't do what you had to do as a man. That much is certain. If you feel even a little bit sorry, then don't make promises like that from now on. If you do the same thing again, I won't forgive you. That much I'll tell you.",
  "status": "translated",
  "style": 0,
  "text_off": 336,
  "text_len": 166
 },
 {
  "id": "sce269:001FA",
  "jp": "トウヤ「‥‥ああ」",
  "off": 506,
  "len": 14,
  "en": "Touya: ...Yeah.",
  "status": "translated",
  "style": 0,
  "text_off": 508,
  "text_len": 11
 },
 {
  "id": "sce269:0020B",
  "jp": "フェイン「‥‥よし。握手だ」",
  "off": 523,
  "len": 21,
  "en": "Fain: ...Right. Let's shake on it.",
  "status": "translated",
  "style": 0,
  "text_off": 525,
  "text_len": 18
 },
 {
  "id": "sce269:00223",
